      'beginner.essentials.eyebrow': 'Must-knows',
      'beginner.essentials.h2': 'Mechanics every beginner must know',
      'beginner.essentials.c1.h': '🏠 What is the DG level?',
      'beginner.essentials.c1.p': 'The Guild level (Development Guild) — the core progression system of the game. Level up by earning contribution medals from villager quests and the main story. Each level unlocks new features, hobbies, or areas. &lt;strong&gt;DG level = your game progress.&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'beginner.essentials.c2.h': '⭐ How to use Wishing Stars?',
      'beginner.essentials.c2.p': 'Earn them from villager quests. Priority: first 5 expansions (10 stars each) → hobby expansion tickets → in a cash crunch, 1 star for a firecracker sold at 1,100 gold. Do &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; splurge on decorations or speed-up items.',
      'beginner.essentials.c3.h': '🕐 When does the server reset?',
      'beginner.essentials.c3.p': 'At 6:00 in-game time (check your watch to confirm the local offset). Daily quests, shop stock, and resource spots (fluorite ore / treant roots) all refresh at this time.',
      'beginner.essentials.c4.h': '🍳 What does leveling hobbies do?',
      'beginner.essentials.c4.p': 'It raises the star quality of your output. For example, 1-star blueberry jam sells for 170 while 3-star sells for 320 — same ingredients, nearly double the price. The higher the hobby level, the better your odds of critting a high-star result.',
      'beginner.essentials.c5.h': '🛒 Bag/storage expansion',
      'beginner.essentials.c5.p': 'Find NPC Ka Ching (across from plot 8 in the northwest suburbs). &lt;strong&gt;The first 5 expansions cost only 10 Wishing Stars (normally 25).&lt;/strong&gt; DG levels 2/7/13/17/19 also grant free expansions. Always buy out the discounted ones first.',
      'beginner.essentials.c6.h': '💰 Where is Albert Jr.?',
      'beginner.essentials.c6.p': 'The wandering merchant roams the whole map with no fixed spot. He pays more than shops. Hold an item to sell in bulk. Watch for him during your daily map laps.',
      'beginner.checklist.eyebrow': 'Core checklist',
      'beginner.checklist.h2': 'Beginner-phase checklist',
      'beginner.checklist.intro': 'Complete everything below and you have graduated from the beginner village:',
      'beginner.checklist.q1': '✅ Reach DG level 5 or higher',
      'beginner.checklist.a1': 'Unlock the three core hobbies: Fishing, Gardening, and Cooking.',
      'beginner.checklist.q2': '✅ Cooking unlocked and in use',
      'beginner.checklist.a2': 'No longer a newbie who only sells raw ingredients.',
      'beginner.checklist.q3': '✅ Complete all 5 villager quests daily',
      'beginner.checklist.a3': 'Roughly 7,000 gold + Wishing Stars + medals per day.',
      'beginner.checklist.q4': '✅ Mastered the four-stove method',
      'beginner.checklist.a4': 'Batch-cook on 4 stoves at once for maximum cooking efficiency.',
      'beginner.checklist.q5': '✅ Built a 10-minute daily routine',
      'beginner.checklist.a5': 'Harvest → gather → fish → cook → quests + selling, for 5,000G+ a day.',
      'beginner.checklist.q6': '✅ Planted your first wheat',
      'beginner.checklist.a6': 'A core late-game crop; the earlier you start, the better.',
      'beginner.checklist.q7': '✅ Bought all 5 discounted bag expansions',
      'beginner.checklist.a7': 'Find Ka Ching — 10 stars each, 50 stars total.',
      'beginner.checklist.q8': '✅ Learned the 100-gold fish-selling line',
      'beginner.checklist.a8': 'Sell high-value fish directly and cook the low-value ones.',
      'beginner.checklist.q9': '✅ Know the fruit-tree tap trick and rainbow-bouquet timing',
      'beginner.checklist.a9': 'Save energy and items while maximizing free-resource gains.',
      'beginner.checklist.q10': '✅ Understand Wishing Star priority: expansion &gt; hobbies &gt; functional furniture &gt; other',
      'beginner.checklist.a10': 'Do not waste a single star — spend every one where it counts most.',

