      'money.rule.rules': '&lt;strong&gt;💰 Three iron rules:&lt;/strong&gt; ❶ sell fish above 100 gold directly, cook the rest ≤100 &amp;nbsp; ❷ turn fruit into jam and vegetables into dishes — never sell raw ingredients &amp;nbsp; ❸ wheat is your economic lifeline; plant it whenever you can',
