      'money.rule.c2.h': '🐟 The fish dividing line: 100 gold',
      'money.rule.c2.p': 'Sardine 40G → cook into fish and chips for 310G&lt;br&gt;Tuna 300G → sell directly; cooking loses money&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="color:var(--green)"&gt;Remember the key threshold: 100G&lt;/span&gt;',
