      'money.routine.eyebrow': 'Daily routine',
      'money.routine.h2': 'The 10-minute efficient money loop',
      'money.routine.intro': 'A standardized routine to run after each login, with an expected yield of 8,000-15,000 gold per round',
      'money.routine.t1.h': '① Morning: harvest + plant (~2 min)',
      'money.routine.t1.p': 'Harvest potatoes/wheat/corn and replant. Prioritize potatoes (3x the yield of tomatoes) and wheat (core ingredient in all late-game high-profit recipes). Plant blueberries and strawberries whenever you have seeds.',
      'money.routine.t2.h': '② Gather: free ingredient sweep (~2 min)',
      'money.routine.t2.p': 'Run the map collecting berries, mushrooms, fruit, and herbs. In autumn, focus on black truffles (200G each, 3-4x profit after cooking). &lt;strong&gt;Free = zero cost = 100% pure profit.&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'money.routine.t3.h': '③ Fish: filter for high value (~3 min)',
      'money.routine.t3.p': 'Head to the ocean for high-value fish (tuna 300+, pufferfish 450). Keep low-value fish ≤100G (sardine, crucian carp, sea bass) as cooking material. &lt;strong&gt;Remember the threshold: sell anything above 100 gold, cook anything below.&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'money.routine.t4.h': '④ Cook: four-stove batch production (~3 min)',
      'money.routine.t4.p': 'Arrange 4 stoves in a square and stand in the middle to manage 4 dishes at once. Prioritize batch production: jam (fruit → 170G+) + fish and chips (fish + potato → 310G) + vegetable medley (3 vegetables → 200G).',
      'money.routine.t5.h': '⑤ Sell + villager quests (~2 min)',
      'money.routine.t5.p': 'Find the wandering merchant Albert Jr. and batch-sell all finished goods. On the way, complete 5 villager quests — each rewards an extra 1,000-3,000 gold + Wishing Stars + contribution medals.',
