      'money.fishing.eyebrow': 'Fishing for money',
      'money.fishing.h2': 'Fishing strategy · from novice to fishing king',
      'money.fishing.intro': 'Fish is the most abundant free resource in the game — the key is knowing what to keep and what to sell',
      'money.fishing.c1.h': '🎯 The 100G threshold rule',
      'money.fishing.c1.p': '&lt;strong&gt;≤100G → keep for cooking:&lt;/strong&gt; sardine (40), crayfish (45), goldfish (50), sea bass (55), common carp (65), crucian carp (80)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&gt;100G → sell raw:&lt;/strong&gt; catfish (110), salmon (120), trout (250), eel (280), tuna (300), pufferfish (450)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legendary:&lt;/strong&gt; legendary koi (2000) and rainbow fish (5000) — sell them! Cooking is a pure loss.',
      'money.fishing.c2.h': '📍 High-profit fishing spots',
      'money.fishing.c2.p': '🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Ocean (summer):&lt;/strong&gt; tuna 300G + pufferfish 450G → 500-1000G per trip&lt;br&gt;🥈 &lt;strong&gt;Ocean (winter):&lt;/strong&gt; king crab 600G → rare but very profitable&lt;br&gt;🥉 &lt;strong&gt;Starlight Sea (spring · rainbow weather):&lt;/strong&gt; rainbow fish 5000G → one catch lifts you out of poverty&lt;br&gt;⭐ &lt;strong&gt;Secret pond (night):&lt;/strong&gt; legendary koi 2000G → a lucky gamble&lt;br&gt;🌊 &lt;strong&gt;River (all year):&lt;/strong&gt; crucian carp 80G → make fried carp for steady profit',
      'money.fishing.c3.h': '📅 Seasonal fishing calendar',
      'money.fishing.c3.p': '🌸 &lt;strong&gt;Spring:&lt;/strong&gt; trout 250G (mountain lake · daytime), rainbow fish 5000G (Starlight Sea · rainbow weather)&lt;br&gt;☀️ &lt;strong&gt;Summer:&lt;/strong&gt; tuna 300G (ocean), pufferfish 450G (ocean · daytime), crayfish 45G (river → make sashimi)&lt;br&gt;🍂 &lt;strong&gt;Autumn:&lt;/strong&gt; eel 280G (river · rainy night), salmon 120G (river / fishing village)&lt;br&gt;❄️ &lt;strong&gt;Winter:&lt;/strong&gt; king crab 600G (ocean) → use full ingredients for steamed king crab sold at 1100G',
      'money.fishing.tree.h3': '🔀 Fishing decision tree (ask yourself after every catch)',
      'money.fishing.tree.c1.q': 'Sell price &gt; 100G?',
      'money.fishing.tree.c1.a': 'Yes → &lt;strong style="color:var(--teal)"&gt;sell raw&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;No → go to step ❷',
      'money.fishing.tree.c2.q': 'Is it crucian carp?',
      'money.fishing.tree.c2.a': 'Yes → &lt;strong style="color:var(--gold)"&gt;fried crucian carp&lt;/strong&gt; (80→350)&lt;br&gt;No → go to step ❸',
      'money.fishing.tree.c3.q': 'Is it crayfish?',
      'money.fishing.tree.c3.a': 'Yes → &lt;strong style="color:var(--gold)"&gt;crayfish sashimi&lt;/strong&gt; (×2→380)&lt;br&gt;No → go to step ❹',
      'money.fishing.tree.c4.q': 'Any low-value fish',
      'money.fishing.tree.c4.a': '&lt;strong style="color:var(--gold)"&gt;Fish and chips&lt;/strong&gt; (+potato → 310G)&lt;br&gt;or &lt;strong style="color:var(--teal)"&gt;seafood risotto&lt;/strong&gt; (×2 + wheat → 450G)',
      'money.fishing.estimate': '&lt;strong&gt;🎣 Fishing income estimate:&lt;/strong&gt; focused on ocean spots, you can catch an average of 15-25 fish per hour. Mixing summer tuna (300G) and sardines (40G → 310G after cooking), the net profit of an hour of fishing + cooking is about &lt;strong style="color:var(--coral)"&gt;3,000-5,000 gold&lt;/strong&gt;. If you hit rainbow weather and catch a rainbow fish, a single one is worth 5,000G.',
      'money.daily.eyebrow': 'Daily income',
      'money.daily.h2': 'Gold cap &amp; maximizing villager quests',
      'money.daily.intro': 'Fixed daily income sources — stable, predictable, and unskippable',
      'money.daily.villager.h3': '📋 The villager quest system',
      'money.daily.villager.th.item': 'Item',
      'money.daily.villager.th.detail': 'Details',
      'money.daily.villager.r1.item': 'Daily quest count',
