      'prog.dg.r20.detail': 'All features unlocked, max level reached. All 7 hobbies maxed, both pets owned, a luxury house — enter free-play mode.',
      'prog.dg.r20.badge': 'Finish',
      'prog.dg.strategy': '&lt;strong&gt;⚡ Core DG leveling strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; never skip the 5 daily villager tasks (the only large source of Contribution Medals) → Cooking churns out extra medals → prioritize main quests (one-time big medals) → higher-star products = more medals = faster leveling. Once the positive loop is set up, Lv.1 to Lv.20 takes about 3-4 weeks.',
      'prog.dg.timegate': '&lt;strong&gt;⏰ Time-gating note:&lt;/strong&gt; the DG level has a daily XP cap — no matter how much you do, the Contribution Medals you can earn per day are capped. This means &lt;strong&gt;you can\'t rush from Lv.1 to Lv.20 in a single day&lt;/strong&gt;. Every stage choice matters; pick wrong and you wait even longer for the next unlock.',
      'prog.hobbies.eyebrow': 'Core Systems',
