      'prog.backpack.eyebrow': 'Space Management',
      'prog.backpack.heading': '🎒 Backpack &amp; Warehouse Expansion · Complete Guide',
      'prog.backpack.intro': 'Backpack space is the most underrated resource in the game — not enough slots = frequent trips home while gathering = your money efficiency is cut in half. Expansion has both free and paid paths; mixing them well maximizes value.',
      'prog.backpack.free.heading': '🆓 Free Expansion',
      'prog.backpack.free.intro': 'The game automatically gifts warehouse expansions at specific DG levels — &lt;strong&gt;completely free, no NPC required&lt;/strong&gt;:',
      'prog.backpack.free.card1': '📦 Warehouse +50 slots',
      'prog.backpack.free.card2': '📦 Warehouse +50 slots',
      'prog.backpack.free.card3': '📦 Warehouse +50 slots',
      'prog.backpack.free.card4': '📦 Warehouse +50 slots',
      'prog.backpack.free.card5': '📦 Warehouse +50 slots',
      'prog.backpack.free.total': '&lt;strong&gt;📊 Total free expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 × 50 slots = &lt;strong&gt;+250 warehouse slots&lt;/strong&gt;. None of this needs any action — just reach the corresponding DG level. Combined with the initial capacity, pure free play reaches about 300-350 warehouse slots.',
      'prog.backpack.paid.heading': '⭐ Wishing Star Expansion (Paid)',
      'prog.backpack.paid.intro': 'Find NPC &lt;strong&gt;Ka Ching&lt;/strong&gt; (across from plot 8 in the northwest suburbs) to buy expansion with Wishing Stars. Note: &lt;strong&gt;backpack and warehouse expansion are bought separately&lt;/strong&gt;, with their discount counts tracked independently.',
      'prog.backpack.paid.th.purchase': 'Purchase Count',
