      'prog.backpack.timeline.r4.capacity': 'Backpack ~150+ slots / warehouse ~550+ slots',
      'prog.backpack.kaChing': '&lt;strong&gt;📍 Ka Ching\'s location:&lt;/strong&gt; northwest suburbs, across from plot 8. This NPC handles backpack and warehouse expansion trades. Note: backpack and warehouse expansion are &lt;strong&gt;two separate purchases&lt;/strong&gt; — you must buy each separately, and their discount counts are tracked separately. Consider buying both to 5 discounts (50 stars each) before any other spending.',
      'prog.house.eyebrow': 'Homestead System',
      'prog.house.heading': '🏠 House Building System · In Depth',
      'prog.house.intro': 'Heartopia\'s building system has two stages: basic blueprint mode (DG Lv.4) and advanced building mode (DG Lv.15). The capability gap is huge — knowing the difference saves you from wasting time in the inefficient mode.',
      'prog.house.compare.heading': '🔷 Blueprint Mode vs Advanced Building',
      'prog.house.compare.th.feature': 'Feature',
      'prog.house.compare.th.blueprint': '🔷 Blueprint (DG Lv.4)',
      'prog.house.compare.th.advanced': '🔶 Advanced (DG Lv.15)',
      'prog.house.compare.r1.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Unlock level&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r1.blueprint': 'DG Lv.4 (automatic)',
      'prog.house.compare.r1.advanced': 'DG Lv.15 (automatic)',
      'prog.house.compare.r2.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Placing walls&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r2.blueprint': 'One at a time — a single block per placement',
      'prog.house.compare.r2.advanced': '✅ &lt;strong&gt;Batch placement&lt;/strong&gt; — drag to place a whole row of walls at once',
      'prog.house.compare.r3.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Laying floors&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r3.blueprint': 'One tile at a time, slow',
      'prog.house.compare.r3.advanced': '✅ &lt;strong&gt;Batch laying&lt;/strong&gt; — select a large floor area at once',
      'prog.house.compare.r4.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Roof design&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r4.blueprint': 'Fixed size, not adjustable',
      'prog.house.compare.r4.advanced': '✅ &lt;strong&gt;Free size adjustment&lt;/strong&gt; — lengthen or narrow as you like',
      'prog.house.compare.r5.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Multi-roof merging&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r5.blueprint': '❌ Not supported',
      'prog.house.compare.r5.advanced': '✅ Merge multiple roofs to avoid a flat look and build depth',
      'prog.house.compare.r6.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Furniture placement&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r6.blueprint': 'One by one, manual adjustment',
      'prog.house.compare.r6.advanced': '✅ Batch operations + precise angle rotation',
      'prog.house.compare.r7.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Undo/redo&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r7.blueprint': 'Limited',
      'prog.house.compare.r7.advanced': '✅ Full undo/redo — no fear of breaking things',
      'prog.house.compare.r8.feature': '&lt;strong&gt;Use cases&lt;/strong&gt;',
      'prog.house.compare.r8.blueprint': 'Placing basic functional furniture (bed, stove, storage box)',
      'prog.house.compare.r8.advanced': 'Full decorating, contest-grade homes, batch construction',
      'prog.house.blueprint.heading': '🏗️ DG 4-14: Using Blueprint Mode Correctly',
      'prog.house.blueprint.p1': 'Before you unlock advanced building (DG 4-14), &lt;strong&gt;don\'t sink lots of time into decorating&lt;/strong&gt;. Blueprint mode is inefficient — walls that take you 2 hours now can be done in 10 minutes with advanced mode at Lv.15, and look better too.',
      'prog.house.blueprint.p2': '&lt;strong&gt;In blueprint mode, only do this:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Place functional furniture: bed, stoves (4 in a square), storage box, workbench&lt;br&gt;② Keep the house open — leave room for your future design&lt;br&gt;③ You can sketch floor plans (on paper or annotated screenshots), but don\'t build&lt;br&gt;④ Gather inspiration: visit friends\' homes, screenshot layouts you like',
      'prog.house.blueprint.p3': '&lt;strong&gt;Core principle:&lt;/strong&gt; in blueprint mode, put all your gold and energy into production tools (seeds, stoves, expansion), not pure decoration. Only start the decorating plan in earnest after Lv.15 advanced building unlocks.',
      'prog.house.advanced.heading': '🎨 DG 15+: Decorating with Advanced Building',
      'prog.house.advanced.p1': 'Once advanced building unlocks, you can finally do real interior design efficiently. Suggested order:',
      'prog.house.advanced.p2': '&lt;strong&gt;Advanced decorating flow:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;① &lt;strong&gt;Floor plan first:&lt;/strong&gt; decide each room\'s function (kitchen zone, bedroom zone, collection display, pet zone)&lt;br&gt;② &lt;strong&gt;Walls and floors:&lt;/strong&gt; batch-lay floors → batch-build walls to separate rooms → resize roofs&lt;br&gt;③ &lt;strong&gt;Multi-roof design:&lt;/strong&gt; use different heights/angles per area to avoid the "one long box" flat look&lt;br&gt;④ &lt;strong&gt;Furniture layout:&lt;/strong&gt; place furniture by function, using advanced mode\'s precise angle rotation&lt;br&gt;⑤ &lt;strong&gt;Finishing touches:&lt;/strong&gt; wall art, ornaments, plants, lighting — these details define quality',
      'prog.house.advanced.p3': '&lt;strong&gt;Core principle:&lt;/strong&gt; advanced building\'s undo is thorough — experiment boldly with layouts, undo what you don\'t like. Visit friends often and screenshot ideas.',
      'prog.house.tips.heading': '💡 Advanced House Building Tips',
      'prog.house.tips.open.heading': '🏗️ Open vs Compartmented',
      'prog.house.tips.open.body': '&lt;strong&gt;Open plan&lt;/strong&gt; (few/no walls): strong sense of space, great for large collections, open sightlines. Good for beginners — fewer walls = fewer mistakes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compartmented&lt;/strong&gt; (many rooms): clear function zones, more privacy, great for themed design (kitchen, study, sun room). Needs advanced building\'s batch wall ability.',
      'prog.house.tips.roof.heading': '📐 Roof Design Tips',
      'prog.house.tips.roof.body': '① &lt;strong&gt;Multi-roof merging:&lt;/strong&gt; different heights/slopes per area → breaks the "box" feel&lt;br&gt;② &lt;strong&gt;Roof color matching:&lt;/strong&gt; coordinate with the wall color — dark roof + light walls = a classic combo&lt;br&gt;③ &lt;strong&gt;Skylight effect:&lt;/strong&gt; leave parts of the roof open → natural light pours in → a big sense of space',
      'prog.house.tips.score.heading': '⭐ Boosting Your Home Score',
